From 41a38944aafb6ef362fa26478bd411d5fc0967e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 06:49:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] estuary: two strings of the player information that no file
 uses

The panel of the player information in one frame no longer has the
headings "Cache" and "Resources" (#32755, #32819 of Estuary's strings of
Hades), and nothing else in Kodi or in LibreELEC Hades uses them. They
are taken out of the four language files.
---
 .../language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po      | 12 ------------
 .../language/resource.language.es_ar/strings.po      | 12 ------------
 .../language/resource.language.es_es/strings.po      | 12 ------------
 .../language/resource.language.es_mx/strings.po      | 12 ------------
 4 files changed, 48 deletions(-)

diff --git a/addons/skin.estuary/language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po b/addons/skin.estuary/language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po
index 5fd484e..aeb84e5 100644
